Error [jet.UsePrivateModuleItem]: `internal` is private in module `math`
  --> tests/ui/module_inline_private.jet:10:16
    |
 10 |     print(math.internal.helper(5))
    |                ^^^^^^^^
 Why: A `priv module` is usable only by its enclosing module
 Fix: Call it from inside `math`, or remove `priv` from `internal: module`
